      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "㭴本训练员的签约赛马娘苦涩糖衣，\n和拜耶尔土耳其一起进行训练，\n她们让我在一旁观摩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fcc7a28bbc650207bc79a6e66dc7dd261b0f43267ff0bf29f527ab1a6ba90ae",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
