      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "拜耶尔土耳其擅长培育强大的赛马娘，\n所以很适合支援想接受严苛训练的苦涩糖衣。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1fa96d0a05ead63462d4e1ca88fb14b71a95825aae2f8c92a9900ce45ab16b2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
