      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "苦涩糖衣对训练的内容感到非常满意，她述说\n自己的梦想，表示即使面对比自己强的对手，\n也能活用优秀的体能与她们进行热血对决。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4956c66722e8e29811a09c3c6afc6d6fdd6c6fabf798d1dbabefbd9eca29ede",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
