      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而，从桐生院训练员的发言来看，\n她似乎正在对快乐米可成长的速度\n比其他赛马娘慢这件事感到烦恼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6c81761fa2a64857c7b706d342aecdcb104d7dbf593f9edd5ae49528cf2a4e9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
