      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "高多芬阿拉伯参考过去的赛马娘资料，\n推测快乐米可跟桐生院训练员想的一样，\n是大器晚成的类型。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcdf6395448dcb6896f0b344e806f0012e013db897d64f39548cd5bc0d6266c8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
